57193", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618102_850674770990526_7422896971220087778_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=IuYSW23lJAgQ7kNvwHndEy4&_nc_oc=AdnLd1mA0ev4fCQEgJWZAyic642fwRWr1-Z9e_4bcE5cAajK3aaiVaC_qzfrtAzIZeg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfswxdvhSWr7JyeV1yn8aF2HKHeXBHcWAgFhZrD4yeO_qw&oe=699C3BD7"}, {"file_name": "jimeng-2025-12-13-3954-\u53bb\u6389\u753b\u9762\u4e2d\u7684\u9f20\u6807\u7bad\u5934.png", "id": "836065415918924", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499620940_836065419252257_206443966995562054_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=N9cx2e0qLqYQ7kNvwFUOgsI&_nc_oc=Adl7jaiKxZWPckyfZJVByyd1yV0DRRRooV69NhFfIy2S4EIcTOMjCw0iU6xCEIqE0e8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsUzr2Kioty2xd5Hz91MvdTBETUlb7rqkx3y_w00T_ZFg&oe=699C62A4"}, {"file_name": "jimeng-2025-12-13-6748-\u53bb\u6389\u753b\u9762\u4e2d\u7684\u9f20\u6807\u7bad\u5934.png", "id": "3182153045297001", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619680_3182153051963667_392283180582857958_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jQRuObofbVwQ7kNvwE-KMNJ&_nc_oc=AdnIdkX22xXJFuRWPZDjOKyT2_9M6IBu9SbO7uvTlkvWW2Lfo49M9Mq8vXP6xAL7LEA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afvdvho0wobdOU0kcim8uN4Xe2vZUngK9rguZuT0nvwKvQ&oe=699C3AC6"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "20251209-232136.png", "id": "1372267231286569", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619113_1372267234619902_275821156816171695_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=t8gYrzEPzXAQ7kNvwE-br7O&_nc_oc=AdlT9g5M4ioBIvIWfBrXmQjttc4z710kCBFad8zUAUNXY1SO5u2n1iuh9hWu-JM160M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftyT8J58taIfp8r93JOkgZNeIPWlznhXQ-jgNTLRcqIWA&oe=699C547D"}, "display_name": "A Very Difficult Game About Walking", "keywords": ["simulator", "funny", "platformer", "challenge", "rage"], "long_description": "In a nutshell, this is unbelievably tough VR game\u2014all about the \u201csimple\u201d act of walking.\n\nYou\u2019ll be strapped into two wobbly AF giant stilts, controlling each one with a hand controller. Try not to panic (spoiler: you will), grab every star you can, and haul yourself to the next level before you faceplant into the ground.\n\nWe originally made this game because we thought stilt-walking in VR would be a total piece of cake. Spoiler #2: We were so wrong. It\u2019s straight-up hell\u2014but shockingly, the kind of hell that\u2019s weirdly addictive and hilarious.\n\nSo we cranked out 42 soul-crushing levels to share this chaotic torture with you. And we\u2019re not stopping there\u2014we\u2019ll keep dropping new levels to make this one-of-a-kind pain (and joy) last even longer. Don\u2019t stress (you\u2019ll definitely stress), you\u2019ve got this\u2026 hopefully you won\u2019t cry while \u201cwalking.\u201d\n", "short_description": "In short, this is an unbelievably difficult game about walking.\nYou will walk with two very shaky high stilts, control them with your two hands - try not to panic (spoiler: you will), collect the stars, enter the next level before you fall."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://skycamp-studio.github.io/Home/privacy-policy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Skycamp Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://skycamp-studio.github.io/Home/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recom